<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - RadiSys cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - RadiSys cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jensen Securities said on Tuesday it had cut its rating on RadiSys Corp to underperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Jensen, in an analysis, cited recent price appreciation.</p>
<p>-- Jensen estimated fiscal 1996 earnings per share at $1.29, and 1997 at $1.50.</p>
<p>-- RadiSys closed at 72-1/2 on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
